From 48b61cd335b8b766604154b573f00fd697b7d683 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: halt95 <halt95@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 09:23:24 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 90/97] envs: the MERLIN_* kernel toggles default to the
 shipped value when unset

MERLIN_FULL_K, MERLIN_QSA_SORT, MERLIN_TIE_DET, MERLIN_TIE_RECENT and MERLIN_TOPK_SORTED_EMIT defaulted to off in
code while every shipped launcher set them to 1, so a launch without them ran a different kernel configuration.
vllm/env_override.py now sets each to 1 when unset; 0 still turns one off. tests/test_merlin_toggle_defaults.py
covers it.
